  "title-post": "How Italian Queen increased its sales by 15%.",
  "current-post-image-src": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/68663566d13b05265804548f_Miniature.avif",
  "current-post-image-sizes": "100vw",
  "current-post-image-srcset": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/68663566d13b05265804548f_Miniature-p-500.avif 500w, /assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/68663566d13b05265804548f_Miniature-p-800.avif 800w, /assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/68663566d13b05265804548f_Miniature-p-1080.avif 1080w, /assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/68663566d13b05265804548f_Miniature.avif 1200w",
  "company-logo-style": "background-image:url(\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/686636c1f8b070a9d9f40cce_logo%20noir.avif\")",
  "title-post-2": "How Italian Queen increased its sales by 15%.",
  "rt-blog-html": "\n          <figure style=\"padding-bottom:56.206088992974244%\" class=\"w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-video\">\n            <div>\n              <iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/_ve7TsLZJdw\" title=\"Italian Queen X Innovorder\" scrolling=\"no\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"true\"></iframe>\n            </div>\n          </figure>\n          <p>Founded by Jonathan Jablonski, the entrepreneur behind Factory&amp;Co, <strong>Italian Queen</strong> is inspired by an American model discovered in 2018: a made-to-order pizza, cooked in 90 seconds. The concept combines <strong>total personalization</strong> and <strong>a fast-casual experience</strong>, in a modern setting in Val d'Europe and now Avignon.</p>\n          <h2>The real challenge: customizing without slowing down</h2>\n          <p>Making each pizza to order is a real asset for the customer, but a <strong>major challenge in the kitchen</strong>. The team has to manage a <strong>high volume of customized orders</strong>, without queuing, without error, and without loss of productivity.</p>\n          <blockquote><em>\"We thought it would be impossible to serve so many customers to order.\"</em></blockquote>\n          <p>‍</p>\n          <h2>Control terminals for easy customization</h2>\n          <p>Kiosks have become <strong>the heart of the customer journey</strong>:</p>\n          <ul role=\"list\">\n            <li>Customers choose their ingredients and supplements.</li>\n            <li>The interface is fast, intuitive and avoids queues.</li>\n            <li>The order goes to the kitchen without friction.</li>\n          </ul>\n          <p>‍</p>\n          <h2>QR codes to recommend and increase the average shopping basket</h2>\n          <p>Another lever is the use of <strong>QR codes on the table and online</strong>, which allow customers to :</p>\n          <ul role=\"list\">\n            <li>Easily recommend a second pizza or dessert.</li>\n            <li>Order without queuing again.</li>\n            <li>Natural sales growth <strong>of 10-15%</strong>.</li>\n          </ul>\n          <blockquote>\"We have an increase in sales but it's between 10 and 15%, which is still very, very strong, and only on reorder.\"</blockquote>\n          <p>‍</p>\n          <h2>What's next?</h2>\n          <p>With Innovorder, <strong>Italian Queen has transformed a restaurant in Val d'Europe into a replicable model</strong>, capable of expanding to other cities while retaining its customer promise: <strong>personalization, speed, quality</strong>.</p>\n          <blockquote><em>\"What we need in a franchise rollout is a partner who is accessible, responsive, and present.\"</em></blockquote>\n          <h3>-</h3>\n          <p>Are you a restaurant owner or looking to launch your own restaurant? Call in an Innovorder expert and find out how to easily manage your restaurants and boost your business!</p>\n        ",
  "right-head": "Italian Queen",
  "bozzolo-cat": "Franchise",
